  - nodeId: 6
    spanishLine: "\xBFQui\xE9n ________ (ir + a + pagar) la cuenta?"
    englishHint: 'This is a future tense. The waiter is asking which individual person
      (he or she) will pay? Ir a pagar - Yo(I) - voy a pagar, Tu(You) - vas a pagar,
